.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
See the module.
.PP
\fBSortHeader\fR: the header of a flat list (\fBVirtualList\fR of \fBMediaRow\fRs): labels over the columns, each with an arrow for its sort direction, driven by a \fBSortState\fR. \fBResponsiveTable\fR has one built in; a flat list does not.
.PP
The columns are given in the same order and widths as the row's, so the labels sit over their cells. A label that does not sort is plain; a space keeps a gap for a picture or a menu.
.PP
.nf
.RS
SortHeader::new(&self.sort, Msg::Sort)
    .space(Length::Fixed(40.0))                          // over the cover
    .column(Col::Title, "Title", Length::FillPortion(3))
    .column(Col::Album, "Album", Length::FillPortion(2))
    .column(Col::Time, "Time", Length::Fixed(44.0))
    .space(Length::Fixed(36.0))                          // over the menu
.RE
.fi
